hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"295","Saron ko (kaat kar) le jane ke bare mein: Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Usamah se, Bashir ibn Uqbah se, Abu Nadrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) dushman se muqabil hue aur farmaya: Jo shakhs (kata hua) sar le kar aayega us ke liye Allah ki taraf se woh hoga jo woh chahega, do aadmi ek sar le kar aaye aur us mein jhagda karne lage to Aap ne us ka faisla un mein se ek ke haq mein farmaya aur farmaya: Allah se jo chaho mango, us ne kaha: Main tez talwar chahta hun jis se main ladun hatta ke qatl kar diya jaun, Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Is mauzu' mein Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se kai ahadith hain jin mein se koi sahih nahin."
